   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Pixelize / unfake\n`auto_detect` finds the real pixel size of blurry or upscaled pixel art (even fractional sizes like 15.6 px) and rebuilds the exact grid. Switch to `fixed_size` to pixelize photos.\nPalette presets include PICO-8, Game Boy, C64, CGA, Endesga, Sweetie 16… Drop Lospec `.hex` files into `custom_nodes/ComfyUI-SpriteKiln/palettes/` to add more."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
